{"id": "sf-safe-gift-boxes", "title": "SF SAFE: grant money withheld from partners, and $162 gift boxes for police brass", "seconds": 145.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "e3f7faaff0c8f0ab", "words": 426, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "For decades, SF SAFE was the Police Department's crime-prevention nonprofit.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.68, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "San Francisco SAFE", "sub": "the Police Department’s crime-prevention nonprofit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.77, 0.93, 1.07, 1.37, 1.48, 1.56, 1.76, 2.23, 2.85]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "The department covered its costs, through a grant.", "t0": 3.8, "t1": 5.88, "shot": "b0x", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "San Francisco SAFE", "sub": "the Police Department’s crime-prevention nonprofit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.04, 0.43, 0.64, 0.82, 1.42, 1.57, 1.67]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "A second City office paid it to run a Mission District safety program, through two smaller groups.", "t0": 6.0, "t1": 10.8, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "hood": "Mission", "hoodLabel": "Mission District", "zoom": "hood", "scale": 2.6, "kicker": "A second City contract"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.39, 0.65, 0.97, 1.18, 1.29, 1.37, 1.5, 1.57, 1.84, 2.25, 2.6, 3.43, 3.63, 3.78, 4.2]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[3]", "established[1]"], "text": "In July 2024, the District Attorney charged its former director, Kyra Worthy. How many felonies?", "t0": 10.92, "t1": 16.93, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Charged: Kyra Worthy", "sub": "former executive director, July 30, 2024"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.37, 0.63, 1.5, 1.63, 1.91, 2.3, 2.59, 2.76, 2.99, 3.71, 3.97, 4.7, 5.24, 5.45]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[1]", "story[3]"], "text": "34 felonies.", "t0": 16.93, "t1": 18.66, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "34", "label": "felony charges", "sub": "filed July 30, 2024"}, "emph": ["34"], "wt": [0.04, 1.05]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "A charge is an allegation, not a conviction. No verdict has been found.", "t0": 19.18, "t1": 23.04, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A charge is an allegation, not a conviction."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.04, 0.43, 0.54, 0.63, 1.44, 1.72, 1.88, 2.41, 2.76, 3.1, 3.28, 3.45]}, {"scene": "charge", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[3]"], "text": "First, the charges. The City paid SF SAFE to pass money on to the two partner groups.", "t0": 23.26, "t1": 27.59, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "The City", "sub": "paid SF SAFE"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "SF SAFE", "sub": "was to pass it on"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Two partner groups", "sub": "prosecutors say: never paid"}], "kicker": "The charge"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.4, 1.05, 1.45, 1.71, 1.97, 2.13, 2.25, 2.49, 2.59, 2.84, 3.11, 3.24, 3.35, 3.43, 3.57, 3.91]}, {"scene": "charge", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[3]"], "text": "Prosecutors say it never did.", "t0": 27.71, "t1": 29.46, "shot": "b5x", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "The City", "sub": "paid SF SAFE"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "SF SAFE", "sub": "was to pass it on"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Two partner groups", "sub": "prosecutors say: never paid"}], "kicker": "The charge"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.6, 0.87, 1.04, 1.35]}, {"scene": "charge", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "400,000 dollars was for Bay Area Community Resources.", "t0": 29.58, "t1": 32.98, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Bay Area Community Resources", "$400,000"], "b": ["Calle 24", "$112,500"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.35, 0.71, 1.18, 1.41, 1.58, 1.85, 2.15, 2.59]}, {"scene": "charge", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "112,500 was for work Calle 24 had already done. In all?", "t0": 33.1, "t1": 38.98, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Bay Area Community Resources", "$400,000"], "b": ["Calle 24", "$112,500"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.28, 0.61, 1.0, 1.2, 1.58, 1.86, 2.06, 2.6, 3.26, 3.75, 3.94, 4.28, 5.07, 5.45]}, {"scene": "charge", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "story[3]"], "text": "512,500 dollars.", "t0": 38.98, "t1": 41.88, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$512,500", "label": "meant for the two partners", "sub": "an allegation"}, "emph": ["512,500"], "wt": [0.04, 0.71, 0.93, 1.29, 1.92, 2.11, 2.34]}, {"scene": "audit", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[0]", "story[1]"], "text": "In January 2024, the Controller, the City's money watchdog, checked nine months of the police grant.", "t0": 42.5, "t1": 48.27, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Controller’s review", "sub": "January 2024, nine months of the police grant", "chip": "$910,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.54, 0.81, 1.45, 1.55, 2.38, 2.47, 2.73, 2.96, 3.88, 4.22, 4.48, 4.81, 4.92, 5.01, 5.36]}, {"scene": "audit", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[0]", "story[1]"], "text": "910,000 dollars.", "t0": 48.39, "t1": 50.6, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Controller’s review", "sub": "January 2024, nine months of the police grant", "chip": "$910,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.73, 1.17, 1.54]}, {"scene": "audit", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[0]", "suspicious[1]"], "text": "How much went to things the grant didn't cover, or that cost too much?", "t0": 50.72, "t1": 53.78, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Ineligible or excessive", "sub": "spending the grant did not cover"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.29, 0.42, 0.5, 0.75, 0.84, 1.09, 1.32, 1.71, 1.82, 1.98, 2.23, 2.4]}, {"scene": "audit", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[0]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "79,655 dollars.", "t0": 53.78, "t1": 57.44, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$79,655", "label": "ineligible or excessive", "sub": "9 percent of $910,000"}, "emph": ["79,655"], "wt": [0.04, 1.45, 1.89, 2.17, 2.46, 3.01]}, {"scene": "audit", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "That's nine percent. It included a Lake Tahoe trip with 4,933 dollars of limousine rides.", "t0": 57.96, "t1": 64.25, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "van", "label": "A Lake Tahoe trip", "sub": "with limousine service", "chip": "$4,933"}, "emph": ["nine percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.42, 1.17, 1.66, 2.05, 2.11, 2.28, 2.68, 3.0, 3.26, 3.45, 3.82, 4.12, 4.4, 4.86, 5.17, 5.27, 5.75]}, {"scene": "audit", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "The grant barred meals, catering, transport and lodging.", "t0": 64.37, "t1": 67.43, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "costs related to meals, catering, transportation, lodging, fundraising or education activities", "kicker": "Ineligible under the grant"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.03, 0.29, 0.59, 1.1, 1.71, 2.22, 2.39]}, {"scene": "audit", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "The department paid without regularly reviewing the receipts, the Controller found.", "t0": 67.55, "t1": 71.3, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "costs related to meals, catering, transportation, lodging, fundraising or education activities", "kicker": "Ineligible under the grant"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.61, 0.97, 1.31, 1.77, 2.15, 2.26, 2.82, 2.9, 3.27]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "story[1]"], "text": "Now the leads, which no one has ruled on. The first is gift boxes.", "t0": 71.52, "t1": 75.5, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "200 gift boxes", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "for a police advisory-board event", "chip": "$32,482"}, "wt": [0.09, 0.15, 0.31, 0.8, 1.0, 1.21, 1.36, 1.56, 1.85, 2.16, 2.47, 2.87, 3.06, 3.36]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "story[1]"], "text": "SF SAFE spent 32,482 dollars on 200 of them. What did each one cost?", "t0": 75.62, "t1": 82.19, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "200 gift boxes", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "for a police advisory-board event", "chip": "$32,482"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.5, 0.77, 1.07, 1.5, 2.01, 2.15, 2.43, 2.9, 3.33, 3.55, 3.69, 4.0, 4.09, 4.53, 5.15, 5.29, 5.48, 5.66]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[0]"], "text": "162 dollars.", "t0": 82.19, "t1": 83.67, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$162", "label": "per gift box", "sub": "a coffee mug, a portfolio, food items"}, "emph": ["162"], "wt": [0.04, 0.17, 0.46, 0.94]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[2]"], "text": "Three police captains reported a box from SF SAFE,", "t0": 84.19, "t1": 86.98, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Who got the boxes", "sub": "three police captains"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.52, 0.97, 1.33, 1.46, 1.69, 1.9, 2.06, 2.21]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[2]"], "text": "worth 160 to 162 dollars.", "t0": 86.98, "t1": 89.72, "shot": "b17x", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Who got the boxes", "sub": "three police captains or commanders"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.24, 0.37, 0.67, 1.07, 1.24, 1.36, 1.61, 2.14]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "The department reimbursed 8,120 dollars of the boxes’ cost.", "t0": 89.84, "t1": 94.09, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Police Department", "sub": "reimbursed $8,120 of the boxes"}, {"art": "money", "name": "SF SAFE", "sub": "buys gift boxes"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Police captains", "sub": "receive the boxes"}], "kicker": "The first lead · a loop"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.02, 0.44, 1.02, 1.24, 1.78, 2.02, 2.3, 2.64, 3.12, 3.28, 3.44, 3.81]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "So grant money came back to its own captains, as gifts.", "t0": 94.21, "t1": 97.0, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Police Department", "sub": "reimbursed $8,120 of the boxes"}, {"art": "money", "name": "SF SAFE", "sub": "buys gift boxes"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Police captains", "sub": "receive the boxes"}], "kicker": "The first lead · a loop"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.35, 0.56, 0.77, 1.01, 1.09, 1.22, 1.38, 2.1, 2.25]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[2]"], "text": "The second lead is timing. Gifts must be reported for the year they're received.", "t0": 97.22, "t1": 100.94, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "October 2022", "to": "2024-02-13", "days": "", "fromLab": "the event", "toLab": "first gift form", "kicker": "The second lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.33, 0.48, 0.64, 1.21, 1.75, 1.95, 2.08, 2.47, 2.59, 2.69, 2.93, 3.3]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[2]"], "text": "These were reported much later. How much later?", "t0": 101.06, "t1": 103.57, "shot": "b19x", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "October 2022", "to": "2024-02-13", "days": "", "fromLab": "the event", "toLab": "first gift form", "kicker": "The second lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.26, 0.66, 0.87, 1.53, 1.79, 2.0]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "Sixteen months. And twenty-six months.", "t0": 103.57, "t1": 106.72, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "sixteen and twenty-six months after the event", "sub": "filed 13 February 2024 and 10 December 2024"}, "emph": ["Sixteen", "twenty-six"], "wt": [0.04, 0.71, 1.69, 2.09, 2.69]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why", "story[2]"], "text": "Both came after the Controller's report of January 18, 2024 made the boxes public.", "t0": 107.24, "t1": 112.53, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "estimate per City … report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.51, 0.69, 0.78, 1.33, 1.72, 1.86, 2.32, 2.83, 3.04, 3.71, 4.16, 4.3, 4.8]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "Not shown: that the officers who got boxes approved the bills.", "t0": 112.75, "t1": 116.02, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That the officers with boxes approved the bills", "That a late $162 gift form broke a rule"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.68, 1.02, 1.13, 1.62, 1.72, 1.94, 2.38, 2.75, 2.87]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "Or that filing late broke a rule.", "t0": 116.14, "t1": 117.81, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That the officers with boxes approved the bills", "That a late $162 gift form broke a rule"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.04, 0.24, 0.6, 0.92, 1.23, 1.33]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[3]", "story[4]"], "text": "SF SAFE ceased operations in January 2024, the District Attorney said.", "t0": 117.93, "t1": 122.07, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "SF SAFE ceased operations", "sub": "January 2024, the District Attorney said; tax exemption revoked, November 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.39, 0.65, 0.99, 1.56, 1.66, 2.11, 2.37, 3.03, 3.16, 3.44, 3.79]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[3]", "story[4]"], "text": "In November 2025, the IRS took away its tax-free status.", "t0": 122.19, "t1": 125.88, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "SF SAFE collapsed", "sub": "tax exemption revoked, November 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.38, 0.65, 1.56, 1.73, 2.12, 2.32, 2.51, 2.68, 3.14]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[3]", "established[4]"], "text": "The charity registry lists it delinquent, with no report for its two biggest City years.", "t0": 126.0, "t1": 130.21, "shot": "b23b", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "“Delinquent, Past Due”", "kicker": "The state charity registry", "sub": "registration 041126; no yearly report for fiscal 2023 or 2024"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.39, 0.83, 1.02, 1.12, 1.91, 2.11, 2.26, 2.63, 2.78, 2.97, 3.11, 3.44, 3.68]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? The court record, and who approved SF SAFE's bills for October 2022.", "t0": 130.33, "t1": 135.74, "shot": "b24", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The court docket in the criminal case"}, {"who": "", "what": "Who approved the October 2022 invoices"}], "focus": 1}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.31, 0.64, 1.0, 1.44, 1.71, 2.23, 2.37, 2.52, 3.03, 3.2, 3.32, 3.66, 3.98, 4.18, 4.57, 4.84]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "established[7]"], "text": "34 felony charges, filed July 2024. The District Attorney lists a matching case as pending.", "t0": 135.86, "t1": 142.67, "shot": "b25", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.4, 0.8, 1.65, 1.94, 2.25, 2.51, 3.44, 4.38, 4.72, 5.11, 5.31, 5.38, 5.76, 6.12, 6.27]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 142.79, "t1": 144.92, "shot": "b26", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.59, 0.77, 1.04, 1.14, 1.25, 1.51, 1.78]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "charge": "The charges", "audit": "The official finding", "lead1": "Lead 1 · $162 boxes", "lead2": "Lead 2 · reported late", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "contrast"}